{"id":"589ff472ca669a86","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-zfc-set9-hereditarily-countable-set.md","title":"ZFC Set9 Hereditarily Countable Set","display":"df-zfc-set9-hereditarily-countable-set — ZFC Set9 Hereditarily Countable Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-set9-hereditarily-countable-set","aliases":["58-df-zfc-set9-hereditarily-countable-set"],"display":"df-zfc-set9-hereditarily-countable-set — ZFC Set9 Hereditarily Countable Set","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-zfc-set9-h-kappa]]","[[58-df-zfc-card6-countable-set]]","[[58-df-transitive-closure]]","[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-set9-hereditarily-countable-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-set9-hereditarily-countable-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-set9-hereditarily-countable-set — ZFC Set9 Hereditarily Countable Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"433e9516a72135ee\" href=\"?note=433e9516a72135ee\" title=\"58-df-zfc-set9-h-kappa\">58-df-zfc-set9-h-kappa</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f02ce1cb4d0ec8b0\" href=\"?note=f02ce1cb4d0ec8b0\" title=\"58-df-zfc-card6-countable-set\">58-df-zfc-card6-countable-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8c8abfb908cc9a24\" href=\"?note=8c8abfb908cc9a24\" title=\"58-df-transitive-closure\">58-df-transitive-closure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (ambient formal setting)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in V\">\\(x\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSet9HereditarilyCountableSet}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSet9HereditarilyCountableSet}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A|\">\\(|A|\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a> 的初始序数基数函数，不是未声明的额外大小参数。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set9\\text{-}hereditarily\\text{-}countable\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcSet9HereditarilyCountableSet}_S(x)\\leftrightarrow |\\operatorname{TC}(\\{x\\})|\\leq\\omega\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set9\\text{-}hereditarily\\text{-}countable\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcSet9HereditarilyCountableSet}_S(x)\\leftrightarrow |\\operatorname{TC}(\\{x\\})|\\leq\\omega\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A set is hereditarily countable exactly when the transitive closure of its singleton is countable; including <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> itself does not alter countability.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":